*.pyc
*:Zone.Identifier

# ── Personal financial data — never commit ───────────────────────────────────
# Transactions, balances, holdings, statements and their backups.
# (A '#' only starts a comment at the START of a line in .gitignore.)
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
*.pdf
backups/

